So the revised plan would be: 12 GPUs, fully on-demand, in an isolated cloud account, targeting completion by Wednesday 06:00 UTC. The cost stays within budget. Before I formally settle, is there anything else either of you needs to flag — Leah, is the data-preparation review close to wrapping up, and Owen, are there any FinOps concerns with the isolated account setup?"}

